cripts/2026/11/10/sea-se-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[1,1,0,1.25],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[2,1,0,2.5],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.0149,"r5":-0.0812,"r1_spy":-0.0112,"r5_spy":-0.0643}}],"quotes":[{"c":"SE 2018 Q2","e":"se","d":"2018-08-21","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"In terms of the downstream value chain, we continue to explore new opportunities in esports and game streaming in order to deepen user engagement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/22/sea-limited-se-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"SE 2018 Q2","e":"se","d":"2018-08-21","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"We will continue to build out our strength in esports streaming and look forward to developing this aspect of the business further.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/22/sea-limited-se-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"SE 2019 Q1","e":"se","d":"2019-05-22","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"So we are going to continually invest in the development and adding the content and the different ways to monetize the game and the social features, community features and even the live streaming features, all those type of things into the game.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/22/sea-limited-se-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SE 2019 Q3","e":"se","d":"2019-11-12","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"In view of our encouraging performance in Q3 and our strong outlook for the remainder of 2019, we have decided to once again raise our guidance for our full-year adjusted revenue for both digital entertainment and e-commerce.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/sea-limited-se-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SE 2019 Q3","e":"se","d":"2019-11-12","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"We are also increasing our guidance for full year adjusted revenue for e-commerce to between $818 million and the $920 million, representing 202.7% to 216.5% growth from 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/sea-limited-se-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SE 2019 Q4","e":"se","d":"2020-03-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"At the same time, the success of our Esports content is reflected in Free Fire's popularity of streaming side.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/03/sea-limited-se-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SE 2019 Q4","e":"se","d":"2020-03-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yanjun Wang","x":"And we also start to see some of our peers switching gear toward focusing more on profitability and cost cutting over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/03/sea-limited-se-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SE 2019 Q4","e":"se","d":"2020-03-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"E-Commerce adjusted revenue increased over 182% year-on-year to $358.3 million in Q4, an increased over 224% year-on-year to reach $942.1 million for the full year, which meant that we exceeded the high end of our twice increased guidance for 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/03/sea-limited-se-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SE 2020 Q1","e":"se","d":"2020-05-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Yanjun Wang","x":"…the economic recession, people still need some form of social engagement and entertainment and what they might pay for game, especially in our market, if you compare to like say, a movie ticket or subscription of streaming services, etc., it is -- that's the reason we call it micro transaction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/18/sea-limited-se-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SE 2020 Q2","e":"se","d":"2020-08-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"Our live streaming feature is growing in popularity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/18/sea-limited-se-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2020 Q2","e":"se","d":"2020-08-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Yanjun Wang","x":"At the same time, we're getting a relief to our sellers and healthy new sellers on board, our platform, etc. So, therefore, you can see from the past results that we're gaining market share in terms of both our growth but also our pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/18/sea-limited-se-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2020 Q3","e":"se","d":"2020-11-17","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"In line with our strong results, we are raising our guidance for both digital entertainment and e-commerce for the full year of 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/18/sea-limited-se-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2020 Q4","e":"se","d":"2021-03-02","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"Free Fire's huge and the growing e-sport and streaming community is another key pillar of our user engagement strategy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/02/sea-limited-se-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2020 Q4","e":"se","d":"2021-03-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"Both businesses exceeded our recently raised full-year guidance for 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/02/sea-limited-se-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2021 Q1","e":"se","d":"2021-05-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"For example, we hosted a dedicated live streaming platform where viewers can customize their avatars and express their views through chat.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/18/sea-limited-se-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2021 Q3","e":"se","d":"2021-11-16","l":"cinema","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"In the recent months, we've partnered with more online and offline merchants such as Google Play in Malaysia, Blue Bird Taxi in Indonesia, FamilyMart in Thailand and Lotte Cinema in Vietnam.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/16/sea-limited-se-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2021 Q4","e":"se","d":"2022-03-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"Both businesses performed in line with our recently raised full year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/03/01/sea-limited-se-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2022 Q2","e":"se","d":"2022-08-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Piyush Choudhary","x":"And what is the likely cost savings with your recent initiatives taken?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/16/sea-limited-se-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2022 Q3","e":"se","d":"2022-11-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"We have also accelerated cost-saving initiatives in our business operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/15/sea-limited-se-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2022 Q3","e":"se","d":"2022-11-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"These improvements were partially offset by severance and early lease termination-related costs and increases in HQ costs, such as a shared R&D staffing and shared server hosting expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/15/sea-limited-se-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2022 Q4","e":"se","d":"2023-03-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"We have also been streamlining game content to improve accessibility and gameplay for all users across diverse markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/03/07/sea-limited-se-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2022 Q4","e":"se","d":"2023-03-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Pang Vittayaamnuaykoon","x":"Is it by way of the take rate increase and this cost-cutting or is there a deliberate attempt to cut off unprofitable GMV in order to achieve this?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/03/07/sea-limited-se-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2023 Q2","e":"se","d":"2023-08-15","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"We're also excited to see recent ecosystem development in diversified user engagement through live streaming and short-form video, as well as affiliate programs, which already brought new growth to Shopee.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/15/sea-limited-se-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2023 Q2","e":"se","d":"2023-08-15","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"For example, we have focused on growing our live streaming feature driving significantly higher participation from buyers, sellers, and creators in the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/15/sea-limited-se-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2023 Q3","e":"se","d":"2023-11-14","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"Third, live streaming has become increasingly popular among sellers, buyers, and the creators in our markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/14/sea-limited-se-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2023 Q3","e":"se","d":"2023-11-14","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"We believe live streaming e-commerce will become a sizable and profitable part of our platform and extend our long-term growth potential.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/14/sea-limited-se-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2024 Q2","e":"se","d":"2024-08-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"We have also launched live ads across our Asian markets, allowing streamers, including both merchants and creators, to insert ads into Shopee Live.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/13/sea-limited-se-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2024 Q2","e":"se","d":"2024-08-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"In Indonesia in June, one in four active streamers paid for live ads.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/13/sea-limited-se-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2024 Q3","e":"se","d":"2024-11-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"Live streaming continues to be a popular format on both the supply and the demand side in our market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/12/sea-limited-se-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2024 Q3","e":"se","d":"2024-11-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"Our division in the second half of last year to invest in building Shopee's live streaming capability has paid off.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/12/sea-limited-se-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2024 Q3","e":"se","d":"2024-11-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"Our buyers are happy with the cost savings we passed on to them and the better customer service we are able to provide.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/12/sea-limited-se-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2024 Q4","e":"se","d":"2025-03-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"In Southeast Asia, live streaming now contributes around 15% of Shopee's overall order volume for physical goods, and in the fourth quarter, our average daily unique streamers and viewers grew strongly at over 40% and 30% respectively, year on year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/03/04/sea-limited-se-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2024 Q4","e":"se","d":"2025-03-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"In Indonesia, we have maintained our lead as the largest live streaming e-commerce platform throughout 2024.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/03/04/sea-limited-se-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2024 Q4","e":"se","d":"2025-03-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Hou","x":"On the other side, on the cost savings side, I think in Forrest's opening, we talked about the chatbot, the -- if you look at our queries, about 80% of the queries are answered by the chatbot already, which is a meaningful cost savings for the -- for our operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/03/04/sea-limited-se-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2024 Q4","e":"se","d":"2025-03-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Thomas Chong","x":"So, that helps to achieve a lot of cost savings, or are we actually seeing the monetization is getting better coming from AI?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/03/04/sea-limited-se-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2026 Q1","e":"se","d":"2026-05-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"In the first quarter, orders from live streaming and short-form video grew more than 50% year-on-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/15/sea-se-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SE 2026 Q2","e":"se","d":"2026-08-11","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Forrest Li","x":"Orders from live streaming and short-form video grew more than 50% year-on-year, accounting for more than 25% of physical good orders in Southeast Asia.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/sea-limited-se-q2-2026-earnings-call-transc